<title>ESTONIA: KROON FIXING BY THE C.BANK FOR MARCH 12/13.</title>
<headline>KROON FIXING BY THE C.BANK FOR MARCH 12/13.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for March</p>
<p>12/13. The Estonia kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark</p>
<p>	 March 12/13     March 11/12</p>
<p> CZK     0.46933	   0.46765</p>
<p> DKK     2.09764	   2.09823</p>
<p> FIM     2.67703	   2.68107</p>
<p> HUF     0.07707	   0.0771</p>
<p> JPY     0.11126	   0.11201</p>
<p> LTL     3.41769	   3.4071</p>
<p> LVL    23.36427	  23.29044</p>
<p> RUR     0.0024	    0.00239</p>
<p> SEK     1.77679	   1.79191</p>
<p> UAH     7.49334	   7.40875</p>
<p> USD    13.6716	   13.6284</p>
<p> XEU    15.54666	  15.55682</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom +372 630 8400 or reuters@reuters.ee</p>
